To avoid confusion, this is a health education poster for some regions in China regarding the prevention and early detection of child sexual abuse (Please see the poster on child sexual abuse prevention knowledge here: (![Child Sexual Abuse Prevention Knowledge Poster](https://www.example.com/posters.jpg)):

Below is a summary of the content of the child sexual education posters:

Key preventive measures against child sexual abuse include:
1. Enhancing communication among family members;
2. Educating children to recognize their body parts;
3. Emphasizing the concept of private areas;
4. Teaching children what constitutes good and bad physical contact;
5. Guiding children on how to distinguish between secrets and when to tell whom.

We ask healthcare providers to strengthen child sexual education during routine diagnosis and consultation processes and raise parents' and teachers' awareness of prevention.

If you have any specific questions or need further assistance, please feel free to ask at any time!
